    "source_assessment": "preserveX SaveAP sets PLive from LivePhysRegs.contains(C|N|Z|V) after stepping backward from block live-outs and emits PH $p with undef only when PLive is false. The extracted prerequisite and 0002 have identical code for it.",
    "binary_assessment": "Failing extracted candidate llc c8fb18cb is frozen in build/near-proof-upstream/candidate/bin. On the original IR, the same llc with recovery disabled, the patch-1-only llc b8006489 and downstream build/llvm-mos/bin/llc exit 0. On IR produced by the candidate up to and including recovery (boids.xy16.recovered.ll, 40 nuw GEPs), patch-1-only, candidate and downstream llc all exit 134 with the same PH $p diagnostic when started after loop-reduce.",
    "decision": "The related record repaired stale X reloads by adding preserveX; this record is a separate liveness defect in how preserveX saves P.",
